<title>USA: Loehmann 2 mln shr offer at $28-3/4/shr.</title>
<headline>Loehmann 2 mln shr offer at $28-3/4/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loehmann's Inc said Wednesday that its public offering of 2,054,000 common shares has been priced at $28 3/4 per share.</p>
<p>Selling stockholders offered all shares and some have granted underwriters a 30-day option to buy up 307,500 more shares to cover over-allotments, if any, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
